(4186438, 602746, 10268, '<td valign="top">The pose really bugs me here, honestly.  Not sure what it is about it that does so, but it really doesn''t appeal to me.<br/> <br/>The lighting is good though, and the background works well with the subject.  it''s just that pose...</td>', 'The pose really bugs me here, honestly.  Not sure what it is about it that does so, but it really doesn''t appeal to me. The lighting is good though, and the background works well with the subject.  it''s just that pose...', '2007-10-22 02:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186440, 603225, 10268, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot!  The bottom of the photo does absolutely nothing for me, but I like the upper half, and the idea you have.  The colors are good too.<br/> <br/>The bottom just seems a little dark, and I don''t really care for the line going across it, as well as the rocks.  Anyway, gave you a seven.</td>', 'I like this a lot!  The bottom of the photo does absolutely nothing for me, but I like the upper half, and the idea you have.  The colors are good too. The bottom just seems a little dark, and I don''t really care for the line going across it, as well as the rocks.  Anyway, gave you a seven.', '2007-10-22 02:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186441, 602006, 10268, '<td valign="top">Subtle, but good!  I like the softness in this, and the composition.  And the relection.  The rainbow doesn''t seem to be emphasized much, nor be a central subject, but I like the shot.  Seven.</td>', 'Subtle, but good!  I like the softness in this, and the composition.  And the relection.  The rainbow doesn''t seem to be emphasized much, nor be a central subject, but I like the shot.  Seven.', '2007-10-22 02:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186442, 603083, 10268, '<td valign="top">Eight.  <br/> <br/>This is beautiful.  The desaturation works really well.  And the colors are fab.<br/> <br/>I''ll be very interested in knowing how you did this.</td>', 'Eight.   This is beautiful.  The desaturation works really well.  And the colors are fab. I''ll be very interested in knowing how you did this.', '2007-10-22 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186444, 603075, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most defined rainbows I''ve seen in this challenge, and you captured it well.  It sucks you weren''t in a more picturesque place when taking the photo.</td>', 'This is one of the most defined rainbows I''ve seen in this challenge, and you captured it well.  It sucks you weren''t in a more picturesque place when taking the photo.', '2007-10-22 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186445, 602868, 10268, '<td valign="top">Simple, and wonderfully captured.  I like the placement of the person and ubrella as well.  The rainbow colors really compliment the yellow of the leaves.  Eight.</td>', 'Simple, and wonderfully captured.  I like the placement of the person and ubrella as well.  The rainbow colors really compliment the yellow of the leaves.  Eight.', '2007-10-22 02:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186446, 602956, 10268, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the skittles shots.  My only criticism is that I think this could be more saturated.  <br/> <br/>Seven.</td>', 'My favorite of the skittles shots.  My only criticism is that I think this could be more saturated.   Seven.', '2007-10-22 02:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186449, 603078, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is really great.  <br/> <br/>The only thing I can say about this that irks me just a bit are the eyes.  I don''t like them looking off behind me.  I had to look at this for a few moments before I realized that''s what I didn''t like.  Instantly I liked the photo.  The lighting is awesome, the little details, like the fingernails are great and really add to the photo.  But something was off for me.  And I''m pretty sure it''s the eyes.</td>', 'This is really great.   The only thing I can say about this that irks me just a bit are the eyes.  I don''t like them looking off behind me.  I had to look at this for a few moments before I realized that''s what I didn''t like.  Instantly I liked the photo.  The lighting is awesome, the little details, like the fingernails are great and really add to the photo.  But something was off for me.  And I''m pretty sure it''s the eyes.', '2007-10-22 02:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186453, 602868, 31399, '<td valign="top">swear this reminds me of Aimee or Tim''s work...lovely...just lovely...beautiful colors, great composition...love it...gl 10+ hope you ribbon</td>', 'swear this reminds me of Aimee or Tim''s work...lovely...just lovely...beautiful colors, great composition...love it...gl 10+ hope you ribbon', '2007-10-22 02:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186475, 603240, 47316, '<td valign="top">Lovely makeup and pretty image. I don''t think rainbow looking at this image though it is colorful it is not in the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely makeup and pretty image. I don''t think rainbow looking at this image though it is colorful it is not in the spirit of the challenge.', '2007-10-22 02:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186555, 602667, 30861, '<td valign="top">Like i said to the cow shooter, "You got cojones" :-)</td>', 'Like i said to the cow shooter, "You got cojones" :-)', '2007-10-22 04:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186562, 603043, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but there really isnt anything to ground the image.  I think a border would really help hold the image together--I find that my eyes are drifting away and there isnt anything to bring me back.<br/> <br/>Likewise, i love how the leaf is B&amp;W in a sea of color, but if you had put a little lower and to the right, it would fit better with the rule of thirds and anchor the image much better.</td>', 'I like the idea but there really isnt anything to ground the image.  I think a border would really help hold the image together--I find that my eyes are drifting away and there isnt anything to bring me back. Likewise, i love how the leaf is B&W in a sea of color, but if you had put a little lower and to the right, it would fit better with the rule of thirds and anchor the image much better.', '2007-10-22 04:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186563, 602495, 84520, '<td valign="top">-Fantastic- idea, very well executed; the only thing missing is LaVar Burton :)</td>', '-Fantastic- idea, very well executed; the only thing missing is LaVar Burton :)', '2007-10-22 04:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186567, 603109, 49109, '<td valign="top">good color and unusual subject. composition is a bit boring, though.</td>', 'good color and unusual subject. composition is a bit boring, though.', '2007-10-22 05:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186570, 603243, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the image is much too busy.  If you had a larger ranbow strip that didn''t repeat, you would still get a cool effect without the barrage of colors.<br/> <br/>However, the distortion in the glass and on the water is mind blowing (in a good way).  I imagine this is what an acid trip feels like :)</td>', 'Great idea, but the image is much too busy.  If you had a larger ranbow strip that didn''t repeat, you would still get a cool effect without the barrage of colors. However, the distortion in the glass and on the water is mind blowing (in a good way).  I imagine this is what an acid trip feels like :)', '2007-10-22 05:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186572, 603078, 49109, '<td valign="top">good styling, pose and expression, background color works well. not enough lighting from the left, rainbow is too dark. strong pixelation on back and arms takes away from the image.</td>', 'good styling, pose and expression, background color works well. not enough lighting from the left, rainbow is too dark. strong pixelation on back and arms takes away from the image.', '2007-10-22 05:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
