(4186682, 602746, 68573, '<td valign="top">The blown highlights in the background are distracting. Nice sharp portrait a little too high key for my taste</td>', 'The blown highlights in the background are distracting. Nice sharp portrait a little too high key for my taste', '2007-10-22 06:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186687, 603037, 67152, '<td valign="top">I think you did a decent job with the metaphor for rainbow - especially when it comes to the bowed branch.  I would have liked a bit better focus overall.</td>', 'I think you did a decent job with the metaphor for rainbow - especially when it comes to the bowed branch.  I would have liked a bit better focus overall.', '2007-10-22 06:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186688, 603040, 68573, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. a liberal crop would have surely added to image by giving more space to the flying flags</td>', 'Lovely capture. a liberal crop would have surely added to image by giving more space to the flying flags', '2007-10-22 06:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186690, 603078, 67152, '<td valign="top">Those are some crazy cool eyelashes!  Really nice lighting and wonderful job of expanding the rainbow theme through the ''tatoo'' and the finger polish.</td>', 'Those are some crazy cool eyelashes!  Really nice lighting and wonderful job of expanding the rainbow theme through the ''tatoo'' and the finger polish.', '2007-10-22 06:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186691, 602958, 67152, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach to the rainbow challenge - I would have liked to see a more direct color metaphor for a rainbow instead of the repeating orange, yellow, red, and greens.</td>', 'An interesting approach to the rainbow challenge - I would have liked to see a more direct color metaphor for a rainbow instead of the repeating orange, yellow, red, and greens.', '2007-10-22 06:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186692, 602044, 64670, '<td valign="top">It''s always challenging to take a great image in full sunlight.  If you''re a photoshop person you may wish to take a look at this image using Shadows/Highlights - it may reduce some of the glare.</td>', 'It''s always challenging to take a great image in full sunlight.  If you''re a photoshop person you may wish to take a look at this image using Shadows/Highlights - it may reduce some of the glare.', '2007-10-22 06:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186693, 603078, 68573, '<td valign="top">nice variation and a great idea for the challenge. This image looks wonderful and stunning but still i feel it could have been much more powerful than this. Cant figure whats missing. The eyes of the model are outstanding and connect immediately with the viewer, maybe the lighting on the lower back could have been a tad brighter. 8</td>', 'nice variation and a great idea for the challenge. This image looks wonderful and stunning but still i feel it could have been much more powerful than this. Cant figure whats missing. The eyes of the model are outstanding and connect immediately with the viewer, maybe the lighting on the lower back could have been a tad brighter. 8', '2007-10-22 06:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186694, 602128, 68573, '<td valign="top">Wow - a simple and yet so powerful concept so beautifully done. I love this</td>', 'Wow - a simple and yet so powerful concept so beautifully done. I love this', '2007-10-22 06:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186695, 602836, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here.  I really would have liked to see real dispersion taking place - a white light being broken into its component colors.  Having the rainbow light as both the incident and dispersed light doesnt quite do it for me - although technically it is a solid image with really good focus on the prism and interesting reflections.</td>', 'I like the concept here.  I really would have liked to see real dispersion taking place - a white light being broken into its component colors.  Having the rainbow light as both the incident and dispersed light doesnt quite do it for me - although technically it is a solid image with really good focus on the prism and interesting reflections.', '2007-10-22 06:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186696, 601901, 68573, '<td valign="top">nice image and a great PP</td>', 'nice image and a great PP', '2007-10-22 06:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186697, 601786, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of a rainbow of colors - really good control of light and focus.  Well done. 7</td>', 'Nice macro of a rainbow of colors - really good control of light and focus.  Well done. 7', '2007-10-22 06:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186698, 603126, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice work to capture a real life rainbow with such a great sky behind it.  You did a nice job of framing it by the trees - but I really think this could have used a boost in colors around the rainbow to really bring it out.</td>', 'Nice work to capture a real life rainbow with such a great sky behind it.  You did a nice job of framing it by the trees - but I really think this could have used a boost in colors around the rainbow to really bring it out.', '2007-10-22 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186699, 602128, 67152, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the feet!  You clearly have met the challenge and have created it with an object that is useful for when those pretty rainbows are around.  I think the only things that I would do a bit differently are rotating the umbrella a bit so that the bottom is parallel to the horizon and to improve the lighting so those great feet are emphasized more.</td>', 'Gotta love the feet!  You clearly have met the challenge and have created it with an object that is useful for when those pretty rainbows are around.  I think the only things that I would do a bit differently are rotating the umbrella a bit so that the bottom is parallel to the horizon and to improve the lighting so those great feet are emphasized more.', '2007-10-22 07:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186701, 602867, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract macro effort - the double bubbles/drops are a cool artifact - not sure how you did that!  The focus doesn''t seem to all that sharp and I can see what appears to be some oversharpening effects.</td>', 'Nice abstract macro effort - the double bubbles/drops are a cool artifact - not sure how you did that!  The focus doesn''t seem to all that sharp and I can see what appears to be some oversharpening effects.', '2007-10-22 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186704, 603107, 67152, '<td valign="top">Paint swatches!  Great idea - and you did such a good job of adding complexity of the lines through the compostion.  Very good vision here.</td>', 'Paint swatches!  Great idea - and you did such a good job of adding complexity of the lines through the compostion.  Very good vision here.', '2007-10-22 07:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186706, 602909, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the standard DPC refraction model for this challenge.  Well lit, well shot, well done.</td>', 'Nice use of the standard DPC refraction model for this challenge.  Well lit, well shot, well done.', '2007-10-22 07:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186709, 602202, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the rainbow to add some drama to the bronze statue.  I think the thing lacking here is a bit more punch in the colors and lighting.  The rainbow is reall well placed but is very faint.</td>', 'Good placement of the rainbow to add some drama to the bronze statue.  I think the thing lacking here is a bit more punch in the colors and lighting.  The rainbow is reall well placed but is very faint.', '2007-10-22 07:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186715, 602428, 67152, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for this shot - the reflections and textured created by the metal work nicely and the curved edges help provide a connection to real rainbows.  But I am not sure I really like the drops - it seems that they are not quite in focus compared to the metal surface.</td>', 'Interesting concept for this shot - the reflections and textured created by the metal work nicely and the curved edges help provide a connection to real rainbows.  But I am not sure I really like the drops - it seems that they are not quite in focus compared to the metal surface.', '2007-10-22 07:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186716, 603167, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depth of field.  However the remainde of the image is rather lackluster.</td>', 'Beautiful depth of field.  However the remainde of the image is rather lackluster.', '2007-10-22 07:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186717, 602872, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great idea - I''m sure it looked more ''rainbow'' in real life - hasn''t translated well this time.</td>', 'Great idea - I''m sure it looked more ''rainbow'' in real life - hasn''t translated well this time.', '2007-10-22 07:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186719, 603037, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location, the extreme sunlight has played havoc a bit - hard to decipher the figures and overall too bright.</td>', 'Beautiful location, the extreme sunlight has played havoc a bit - hard to decipher the figures and overall too bright.', '2007-10-22 07:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186720, 602006, 64670, '<td valign="top">Really very beautiful image.  Not ''rainbow'' for me though.</td>', 'Really very beautiful image.  Not ''rainbow'' for me though.', '2007-10-22 07:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186722, 603064, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really interesting effort - you did a really  nice job of using lens artifacts to add the rainbow and to create a cool sunburst.  The control of focus seems to be a bit off - especially around the outstretched hand on the left of the image</td>', 'Really interesting effort - you did a really  nice job of using lens artifacts to add the rainbow and to create a cool sunburst.  The control of focus seems to be a bit off - especially around the outstretched hand on the left of the image', '2007-10-22 07:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186724, 602497, 64670, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, however you haven''t created a ''rainbow'' which in this image I feel really needed to happen to make it fit the challenge - at this stage it''s just a range of colours of felt.</td>', 'Nice idea, however you haven''t created a ''rainbow'' which in this image I feel really needed to happen to make it fit the challenge - at this stage it''s just a range of colours of felt.', '2007-10-22 07:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186725, 602848, 64670, '<td valign="top">I think the glass is quite lovely - I feel the flower inside is not and was probably unnecessary.</td>', 'I think the glass is quite lovely - I feel the flower inside is not and was probably unnecessary.', '2007-10-22 07:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186727, 602956, 64670, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the idea seemed good, but it''s not come off well at all.  The light is too harsh - there is no true, clear and interesting focal point.</td>', 'I''m sure the idea seemed good, but it''s not come off well at all.  The light is too harsh - there is no true, clear and interesting focal point.', '2007-10-22 07:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186729, 603117, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice out of the box entry - i really like the strong vertical lines in this one - the placement of the man in the lower right to set the size component and the ''double rainbow'' created by the cool light.</td>', 'Nice out of the box entry - i really like the strong vertical lines in this one - the placement of the man in the lower right to set the size component and the ''double rainbow'' created by the cool light.', '2007-10-22 07:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186730, 603040, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the sharp diagonal lines of the flags and the crisp clean colors  - but there are some significant oversharpening effects (halos) on the flagpoles that are unfortunate.</td>', 'I love the sharp diagonal lines of the flags and the crisp clean colors  - but there are some significant oversharpening effects (halos) on the flagpoles that are unfortunate.', '2007-10-22 07:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186733, 602827, 67152, '<td valign="top">You are clearly going at a different approach for rainbows but it seems a bit of a stretch for me in this challenge.  From a photograph perspective, the image itself is pretty well done - the details in the oyster are nicely captured.</td>', 'You are clearly going at a different approach for rainbows but it seems a bit of a stretch for me in this challenge.  From a photograph perspective, the image itself is pretty well done - the details in the oyster are nicely captured.', '2007-10-22 07:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186737, 603233, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice concept shot - but the image really does not work for a couple of reasons.  First, the screen or fabric that is used is readily in view and we can see all the wrinkles and seams etc.  By moving the ''pot of gold'' farther away from the fabric and shooting it - you would avoid the harsh shadows.   Second, the perspective does not really work - I think a lower angle for the shot would have worked better.</td>', 'Nice concept shot - but the image really does not work for a couple of reasons.  First, the screen or fabric that is used is readily in view and we can see all the wrinkles and seams etc.  By moving the ''pot of gold'' farther away from the fabric and shooting it - you would avoid the harsh shadows.   Second, the perspective does not really work - I think a lower angle for the shot would have worked better.', '2007-10-22 07:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186738, 602106, 77543, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a "rainbow" of colours in this picture</td>', 'I don''t see a "rainbow" of colours in this picture', '2007-10-22 07:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186739, 603046, 77543, '<td valign="top">It might have been better if you had arranged the crayons in the right order.</td>', 'It might have been better if you had arranged the crayons in the right order.', '2007-10-22 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186741, 602044, 77543, '<td valign="top">I don''t see all the colours of a rainbow in this picture.</td>', 'I don''t see all the colours of a rainbow in this picture.', '2007-10-22 07:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186743, 603225, 77543, '<td valign="top">nice lineup. I would have changed the camera position or cropped to remove the bottom of the wall and ground.</td>', 'nice lineup. I would have changed the camera position or cropped to remove the bottom of the wall and ground.', '2007-10-22 07:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186744, 601822, 77543, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The yellow and orange are in the wrong order.</td>', 'Nice idea. The yellow and orange are in the wrong order.', '2007-10-22 07:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186754, 603227, 78196, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge in quite an interesting way - I wonder if you could have been more imaginative with the composition.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge in quite an interesting way - I wonder if you could have been more imaginative with the composition.', '2007-10-22 07:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186756, 603037, 78196, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch for the challenge and lacking in sharpness.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch for the challenge and lacking in sharpness.', '2007-10-22 07:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186757, 603064, 78196, '<td valign="top">That''s rather clever - was it deliberate? Works on many levels. Pity about the tree really but you can''t help that.</td>', 'That''s rather clever - was it deliberate? Works on many levels. Pity about the tree really but you can''t help that.', '2007-10-22 07:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186758, 603112, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good composition and choice of subject, however I''m not convinced by your jpeg compression - it does seem a little pixellated and lacking in definition.</td>', 'Good composition and choice of subject, however I''m not convinced by your jpeg compression - it does seem a little pixellated and lacking in definition.', '2007-10-22 07:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186760, 600656, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the eyes though on the whole I''m not totally convinced by the lighting. Good composition and choice of subject.</td>', 'Nice work on the eyes though on the whole I''m not totally convinced by the lighting. Good composition and choice of subject.', '2007-10-22 07:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186761, 602451, 78196, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean, elegant.</td>', 'Simple, clean, elegant.', '2007-10-22 07:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186762, 602408, 78196, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well, without creating anything particularly remarkable on a photographic level. But with challenges like this, that is so hard to do.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well, without creating anything particularly remarkable on a photographic level. But with challenges like this, that is so hard to do.', '2007-10-22 07:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186771, 602958, 77543, '<td valign="top">There are not enough colours to qualify as a rainbow</td>', 'There are not enough colours to qualify as a rainbow', '2007-10-22 08:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186772, 602519, 77543, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but it looks flat.</td>', 'Nice idea but it looks flat.', '2007-10-22 08:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186774, 602956, 77543, '<td valign="top">There are not enough colours to make a rainbow.</td>', 'There are not enough colours to make a rainbow.', '2007-10-22 08:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186775, 602773, 77543, '<td valign="top">There are no blues</td>', 'There are no blues', '2007-10-22 08:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186777, 602497, 77543, '<td valign="top">The colours are in the wrong order.</td>', 'The colours are in the wrong order.', '2007-10-22 08:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186779, 603031, 78196, '<td valign="top">The rainbows stand out very well indeed - I think overall there is a slight lack of sharpness (being picky here) which might be caused by focusing on the rainbow.</td>', 'The rainbows stand out very well indeed - I think overall there is a slight lack of sharpness (being picky here) which might be caused by focusing on the rainbow.', '2007-10-22 08:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186781, 603204, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice color and bokeh, but the foreground is unclear</td>', 'nice color and bokeh, but the foreground is unclear', '2007-10-22 08:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186783, 602495, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea! have the feeling, the image was tilted to the right (though it isn''t really). light is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'nice idea! have the feeling, the image was tilted to the right (though it isn''t really). light is a bit too harsh.', '2007-10-22 08:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186785, 602992, 49109, '<td valign="top">great idea, nicely executed. lighting could be improved, reflections on the pot distract</td>', 'great idea, nicely executed. lighting could be improved, reflections on the pot distract', '2007-10-22 08:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186788, 601795, 49109, '<td valign="top">beautiful, like it was painted</td>', 'beautiful, like it was painted', '2007-10-22 08:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186800, 602872, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but a bit lacking overall. I think  maybe if you had poured some water on it to get the rainbow in from the oil and water rather than just the oil and pavement you may have had a stronger image. As is though a bit flat as an image.</td>', 'Interesting idea but a bit lacking overall. I think  maybe if you had poured some water on it to get the rainbow in from the oil and water rather than just the oil and pavement you may have had a stronger image. As is though a bit flat as an image.', '2007-10-22 08:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186803, 603126, 53147, '<td valign="top">I like that you caught a natural rainbow, but the colors on the rest of the image seem a bit heavy on the yellow side. A little more work on the colors of the landscape would have left you with a stronger image IMHO.</td>', 'I like that you caught a natural rainbow, but the colors on the rest of the image seem a bit heavy on the yellow side. A little more work on the colors of the landscape would have left you with a stronger image IMHO.', '2007-10-22 08:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186805, 603225, 49109, '<td valign="top">that''s funny. What the heck is the Mr. Orange doing there? Oh, I just notice, Ms Blue is missing. Is that why Mr. Green wears  Jeans?</td>', 'that''s funny. What the heck is the Mr. Orange doing there? Oh, I just notice, Ms Blue is missing. Is that why Mr. Green wears  Jeans?', '2007-10-22 08:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186806, 603165, 53147, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean compostion. I really like the screen texture of your background for some reason. Very nice colors and detail.</td>', 'Simple and clean compostion. I really like the screen texture of your background for some reason. Very nice colors and detail.', '2007-10-22 08:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186811, 602833, 49109, '<td valign="top">beautiful! my top pick so far (Ursula?)</td>', 'beautiful! my top pick so far (Ursula?)', '2007-10-22 08:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186812, 602735, 53147, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and general composition of this shot. What I dont like is how dark the shadows are on the bottom. Most of the detail is lost (at least on my monitor - and mine tends to be a bit on the bright side). More light down there in PP could have made this a stronger image IMO. But a good find and good fit for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the colors and general composition of this shot. What I dont like is how dark the shadows are on the bottom. Most of the detail is lost (at least on my monitor - and mine tends to be a bit on the bright side). More light down there in PP could have made this a stronger image IMO. But a good find and good fit for the challenge.', '2007-10-22 08:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186815, 603227, 53147, '<td valign="top">Easily fits the challenge but lacks any real WOW power to it. Appears technically clean and has a decent composition but nothing to really set it apart.</td>', 'Easily fits the challenge but lacks any real WOW power to it. Appears technically clean and has a decent composition but nothing to really set it apart.', '2007-10-22 08:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186817, 602109, 53147, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t do much for me. As an abstract it doesnt really grab my attention. Nice colors and it fits the challenge for sure, but not a whole lot to keep me here wanting to look at it more.</td>', 'This one doesn''t do much for me. As an abstract it doesnt really grab my attention. Nice colors and it fits the challenge for sure, but not a whole lot to keep me here wanting to look at it more.', '2007-10-22 08:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186821, 603204, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and you have met the challenge, but the interest factor for me is a bit low. Just a bit too abstract for me I guess.</td>', 'Nice colors and you have met the challenge, but the interest factor for me is a bit low. Just a bit too abstract for me I guess.', '2007-10-22 08:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186822, 602290, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good catch of a natural double rainbow. Good contrast against your desolate scenery as well. Very good find and an overall pleasing image.</td>', 'Good catch of a natural double rainbow. Good contrast against your desolate scenery as well. Very good find and an overall pleasing image.', '2007-10-22 08:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186829, 602746, 53147, '<td valign="top">Even though I know whose this is I am going to vote on it. I didnt see it pre-challenge so this is still my first time seeing it. Great colors and detail. I am always in awe of how Kita has stepped up to the plate and is so willing in these shots. Great little poser (said in a very positive way). I hope Rowan follows in her shoes. Very nice image.</td>', 'Even though I know whose this is I am going to vote on it. I didnt see it pre-challenge so this is still my first time seeing it. Great colors and detail. I am always in awe of how Kita has stepped up to the plate and is so willing in these shots. Great little poser (said in a very positive way). I hope Rowan follows in her shoes. Very nice image.', '2007-10-22 08:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186830, 602598, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good colors and detail, but I gotta say that these types of shots really dont grab me. Odds are it is scoring very well, but it just leaves me wanting to move on to the next pic.</td>', 'Good colors and detail, but I gotta say that these types of shots really dont grab me. Odds are it is scoring very well, but it just leaves me wanting to move on to the next pic.', '2007-10-22 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186831, 602820, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a natural rainbow, and your scenery around it is the best I have seen so far in this challenge. Very pleasing image.</td>', 'Great capture of a natural rainbow, and your scenery around it is the best I have seen so far in this challenge. Very pleasing image.', '2007-10-22 08:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186835, 603083, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. Great detail and idea. Has a feel of Qart about it. I expect this to score well.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. Great detail and idea. Has a feel of Qart about it. I expect this to score well.', '2007-10-22 08:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186855, 602451, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really cool perspective shot.  Excellent job of composition to have the lines completely in balance.</td>', 'Really cool perspective shot.  Excellent job of composition to have the lines completely in balance.', '2007-10-22 08:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186856, 602848, 67152, '<td valign="top">I just like this one - the grain created by the glass in front of the flower adds such a great complexity to the image - as if it is an impressionistic painting.  The colors of the rainbow are there and I give you full credit but I worry that others may not be so generous - good luck!</td>', 'I just like this one - the grain created by the glass in front of the flower adds such a great complexity to the image - as if it is an impressionistic painting.  The colors of the rainbow are there and I give you full credit but I worry that others may not be so generous - good luck!', '2007-10-22 08:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186857, 603046, 78196, '<td valign="top">Poor quality image with harsh lighting.</td>', 'Poor quality image with harsh lighting.', '2007-10-22 08:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186859, 603225, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Really nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent. Really nice take on the challenge.', '2007-10-22 08:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186860, 602497, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of diagonals to add interest to this shot.  the details on the felt are really well captured.  This image does not jump out at me but it is a good solid image and well done technically.</td>', 'nice use of diagonals to add interest to this shot.  the details on the felt are really well captured.  This image does not jump out at me but it is a good solid image and well done technically.', '2007-10-22 08:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186862, 602044, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good use of title to connect this to the challenge - a bit of a stretch - but still okay in my book.  The issue I have is the significantly blown out section in the foreground.  The colors in the trees are really warm and appealing, however.</td>', 'Good use of title to connect this to the challenge - a bit of a stretch - but still okay in my book.  The issue I have is the significantly blown out section in the foreground.  The colors in the trees are really warm and appealing, however.', '2007-10-22 08:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186864, 602992, 78196, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice idea and well executed.</td>', 'Quite a nice idea and well executed.', '2007-10-22 08:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186865, 602773, 68546, '<td valign="top">I like it, the composition, colours, DOF are all good.</td>', 'I like it, the composition, colours, DOF are all good.', '2007-10-22 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186866, 601901, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like this. The umbrella clashes brutally with the harsh drabness of his surroundings.</td>', 'I like this. The umbrella clashes brutally with the harsh drabness of his surroundings.', '2007-10-22 09:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186868, 600656, 68546, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, the eyes are amazing. The light is reflecting a little harshly off the mettalic face paint, particularly on the nose and the colours don''t really scream rainbow. However a great image - 7</td>', 'Excellent portrait, the eyes are amazing. The light is reflecting a little harshly off the mettalic face paint, particularly on the nose and the colours don''t really scream rainbow. However a great image - 7', '2007-10-22 09:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186870, 603243, 68546, '<td valign="top">Great concept! The bright colours and small stripe hurt my eyes but the composition and concept are good</td>', 'Great concept! The bright colours and small stripe hurt my eyes but the composition and concept are good', '2007-10-22 09:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
