(4186898, 602652, 85679, '<td valign="top">Love the concept , love the colors, particulary the fact that the  actual eye has no color...Love it!!!</td>', 'Love the concept , love the colors, particulary the fact that the  actual eye has no color...Love it!!!', '2007-10-22 09:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186906, 603095, 85679, '<td valign="top">The motion in this photographs is amazing, the smile from the side is powerfull, and the concept of the raibow is strong in the composition, very NICE!!!</td>', 'The motion in this photographs is amazing, the smile from the side is powerfull, and the concept of the raibow is strong in the composition, very NICE!!!', '2007-10-22 09:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186913, 603078, 68546, '<td valign="top">Excellent studio shot, the background colour works really well and the lighting and focus are excellent. I''m not sure if a light highlighting the rainbow a bit better would be beneficial or detrimental.</td>', 'Excellent studio shot, the background colour works really well and the lighting and focus are excellent. I''m not sure if a light highlighting the rainbow a bit better would be beneficial or detrimental.', '2007-10-22 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186967, 602746, 68546, '<td valign="top">Excellent - a definite top ten. An excellent portrait with a well integrated rainbow theme - 9</td>', 'Excellent - a definite top ten. An excellent portrait with a well integrated rainbow theme - 9', '2007-10-22 10:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186969, 603240, 68546, '<td valign="top">Love the crop, lighting, sharpness, colour, expression! A fantastic portrait, very weak link to rainbow but there is link and so I rate this highly</td>', 'Love the crop, lighting, sharpness, colour, expression! A fantastic portrait, very weak link to rainbow but there is link and so I rate this highly', '2007-10-22 10:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186972, 602306, 68546, '<td valign="top">I think the best natural rainbow shot in the challenge. A good lanscape shot enhanced by a rainbow!</td>', 'I think the best natural rainbow shot in the challenge. A good lanscape shot enhanced by a rainbow!', '2007-10-22 10:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186973, 601795, 68546, '<td valign="top">Very very subtle but such a beautiful scene - 8</td>', 'Very very subtle but such a beautiful scene - 8', '2007-10-22 10:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187001, 602106, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.  Not reall a great turkey shot though.  The shade is distracting as is the angle of the head - would have been nice to see the eye more directly.  Finally I can''t see any rainbows on the turkey - really misses the subject for me.</td>', 'Great depth of field.  Not reall a great turkey shot though.  The shade is distracting as is the angle of the head - would have been nice to see the eye more directly.  Finally I can''t see any rainbows on the turkey - really misses the subject for me.', '2007-10-22 10:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187004, 602773, 64670, '<td valign="top">Nice enough idea, however the lights are far too harsh on this image.  Something also appears to have gone astray with the processing, the orange skittles have strange colour casts.</td>', 'Nice enough idea, however the lights are far too harsh on this image.  Something also appears to have gone astray with the processing, the orange skittles have strange colour casts.', '2007-10-22 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187010, 603117, 64670, '<td valign="top">Unusual location, well done for finding it.  This image does not say ''rainbow'' in any way to me.  Although it shows me a large space, I can''t really tell where you want me to focus my attention.  The man in the blue/white shirt to the right is quite prominent, the staff (?) at the back also draw my eye, but neither of those are what I think you want me to ''see''.<br/> <br/>If it was the orange colum and reflection that you were wanting to present then I think cropping other distractions where possible would have been best.</td>', 'Unusual location, well done for finding it.  This image does not say ''rainbow'' in any way to me.  Although it shows me a large space, I can''t really tell where you want me to focus my attention.  The man in the blue/white shirt to the right is quite prominent, the staff (?) at the back also draw my eye, but neither of those are what I think you want me to ''see''. If it was the orange colum and reflection that you were wanting to present then I think cropping other distractions where possible would have been best.', '2007-10-22 10:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187023, 603204, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the multiple layers of rainbow in this image - the sweeping shapes of the ribbon and the cool balls of reflection in the upper portion of the image.  The one thing that I am not crazy about is the cropping - it seems too closed in as a portrait - i wonder if a square crop would have allowed this one to breathe more.</td>', 'I like the multiple layers of rainbow in this image - the sweeping shapes of the ribbon and the cool balls of reflection in the upper portion of the image.  The one thing that I am not crazy about is the cropping - it seems too closed in as a portrait - i wonder if a square crop would have allowed this one to breathe more.', '2007-10-22 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187101, 603040, 56275, '<td valign="top">Colors turned out nicely. I like the angles. Too bad about the anti-aliasing on the poles. Nice shot over all.</td>', 'Colors turned out nicely. I like the angles. Too bad about the anti-aliasing on the poles. Nice shot over all.', '2007-10-22 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187137, 602652, 67152, '<td valign="top">That has to be the palest blue eye I have ever seen!<br/> <br/>I like the makeup to make the rainbow.  But the eye itself seems to lack some punch - a bit more contrast might help. A slightly different angle of the shot might also do the trick - it seems to be shot while looking down at the eye - would bring out that awesome pale iris by allowing more light on the eye itself</td>', 'That has to be the palest blue eye I have ever seen! I like the makeup to make the rainbow.  But the eye itself seems to lack some punch - a bit more contrast might help. A slightly different angle of the shot might also do the trick - it seems to be shot while looking down at the eye - would bring out that awesome pale iris by allowing more light on the eye itself', '2007-10-22 11:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187138, 602427, 85097, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2007-10-22 11:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187147, 603064, 56275, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Wish the sun wasn''t so blown out though. Perhaps it would have worked better as a true silhouette shot from a lower angel, and without the sun? Not sure if you would have been able to capture the rainbow that way though.</td>', 'I like the idea. Wish the sun wasn''t so blown out though. Perhaps it would have worked better as a true silhouette shot from a lower angel, and without the sun? Not sure if you would have been able to capture the rainbow that way though.', '2007-10-22 11:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187149, 602109, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of rich colors in this image - i like how the ''rainbow'' theme is maintained through the curved line.  The things that bother me a bit are crispness of focus around the image -especially at the edge of the bubble - and the cropping - it seems that the image is closed down too much with the horizontal placement.  A more squared crop might open it up a bit more.</td>', 'nice use of rich colors in this image - i like how the ''rainbow'' theme is maintained through the curved line.  The things that bother me a bit are crispness of focus around the image -especially at the edge of the bubble - and the cropping - it seems that the image is closed down too much with the horizontal placement.  A more squared crop might open it up a bit more.', '2007-10-22 11:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187150, 602106, 56275, '<td valign="top">Never really thought of a turkey''s head as a rainbow.. but I guess it sort of is! Good focus and angel. Would have been nice if you could avoid the shadow on his head.</td>', 'Never really thought of a turkey''s head as a rainbow.. but I guess it sort of is! Good focus and angel. Would have been nice if you could avoid the shadow on his head.', '2007-10-22 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187152, 602848, 44877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and brilliant - love the light and the blur, not to mention the gorgeous colors. Excellent work.</td>', 'Beautiful and brilliant - love the light and the blur, not to mention the gorgeous colors. Excellent work.', '2007-10-22 11:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187156, 601727, 56275, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot photo. Sharpening looks a bit overdone, but not bad. Looks like the kitty is ready to bolt out of there. I''m guessing there were quite a few takes to get this shot!</td>', 'Nice snapshot photo. Sharpening looks a bit overdone, but not bad. Looks like the kitty is ready to bolt out of there. I''m guessing there were quite a few takes to get this shot!', '2007-10-22 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187160, 602541, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderfully processed image - the rainbow above the steeple is very cool.  The sky seems so surreal and the repeating triangles throughout adds so much.</td>', 'wonderfully processed image - the rainbow above the steeple is very cool.  The sky seems so surreal and the repeating triangles throughout adds so much.', '2007-10-22 12:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187161, 603046, 56275, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t do much for me. Foil is blown out, and the dirty background is distracting. A different angle may have improved this shot. Perhaps with the box on its side and the crayons spilling out.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t do much for me. Foil is blown out, and the dirty background is distracting. A different angle may have improved this shot. Perhaps with the box on its side and the crayons spilling out.', '2007-10-22 12:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187162, 601688, 56275, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. Having a subject in the foreground would have made it more interesting and would better direct the viewer''s eye.</td>', 'Pretty shot. Having a subject in the foreground would have made it more interesting and would better direct the viewer''s eye.', '2007-10-22 12:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187165, 601139, 56275, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The b/w background helps the colors pop out.</td>', 'Nice shot. The b/w background helps the colors pop out.', '2007-10-22 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187167, 601901, 56275, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! The coloring, saturation, levels, composition, and his expression are all great. 10</td>', 'I love this shot! The coloring, saturation, levels, composition, and his expression are all great. 10', '2007-10-22 12:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187168, 603227, 67152, '<td valign="top">That is one cool building!  The image is well composed - a good balance of foreground and sky and nice placement of the main subject off to the side.  However, there are some issues with regard to sharpness that could easily be remedied.  In addition, the sky has a strange look about it (as if it is slightly blotchy).</td>', 'That is one cool building!  The image is well composed - a good balance of foreground and sky and nice placement of the main subject off to the side.  However, there are some issues with regard to sharpness that could easily be remedied.  In addition, the sky has a strange look about it (as if it is slightly blotchy).', '2007-10-22 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187175, 603075, 67152, '<td valign="top">That is one great view!  I love the double rainbow framing the sign.  A really good job capturing the lovely clouds.</td>', 'That is one great view!  I love the double rainbow framing the sign.  A really good job capturing the lovely clouds.', '2007-10-22 12:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187178, 602541, 56275, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous. Very surreal looking photo. The deep colors and contrast are great. 10</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous. Very surreal looking photo. The deep colors and contrast are great. 10', '2007-10-22 12:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187179, 603083, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image - perfect for the challenge (IMO).</td>', 'Gorgeous image - perfect for the challenge (IMO).', '2007-10-22 12:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187181, 602306, 52549, '<td valign="top">How beautiful! My top scorer so far.</td>', 'How beautiful! My top scorer so far.', '2007-10-22 12:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187182, 602958, 56275, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using Skittles.. but the straight line is not very interesting. An S-curve or a pile of Skittles maybe?</td>', 'I like the idea of using Skittles.. but the straight line is not very interesting. An S-curve or a pile of Skittles maybe?', '2007-10-22 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187183, 601901, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot - love it.</td>', 'This is a great shot - love it.', '2007-10-22 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1);
