(4187320, 602109, 69368, '<td valign="top">could be a tad sharper, IMO, I quite like it, though</td>', 'could be a tad sharper, IMO, I quite like it, though', '2007-10-22 13:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187327, 602496, 69368, '<td valign="top">exellent clarity!</td>', 'exellent clarity!', '2007-10-22 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187330, 603112, 12998, '<td valign="top">Like the bubbles and the reflection but the background seems cluttered and distracting.</td>', 'Like the bubbles and the reflection but the background seems cluttered and distracting.', '2007-10-22 13:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187332, 603138, 85097, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I wish the rainbow were a little bit more visible though.</td>', 'This is a great shot, I wish the rainbow were a little bit more visible though.', '2007-10-22 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187335, 602667, 12998, '<td valign="top">This had a lot of potential!  I wish it was lighter and more in focus.</td>', 'This had a lot of potential!  I wish it was lighter and more in focus.', '2007-10-22 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187343, 602992, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the use of candy to make the rainbow.  The image is pretty well composed - maybe placing the pot a bit more to the right may help with the balance of the image.  The thing that bothers me a bit is the harsh lighting - the harsh light on the candy seem to wash it out too much</td>', 'I like the use of candy to make the rainbow.  The image is pretty well composed - maybe placing the pot a bit more to the right may help with the balance of the image.  The thing that bothers me a bit is the harsh lighting - the harsh light on the candy seem to wash it out too much', '2007-10-22 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187345, 602016, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent and subtle use of refraction to give the rainbow.  i sure hope others see it as clearly.</td>', 'Excellent and subtle use of refraction to give the rainbow.  i sure hope others see it as clearly.', '2007-10-22 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187346, 602820, 67152, '<td valign="top">An excellent image in so many ways - well composed and balanced.  The layers of water, grasses, hills and clouds really provides nice depth to the image.  The cropping to have the rainbow disappear in the upper right grounds the image very well.  I like how we can barely see the blue, indigo and violet.</td>', 'An excellent image in so many ways - well composed and balanced.  The layers of water, grasses, hills and clouds really provides nice depth to the image.  The cropping to have the rainbow disappear in the upper right grounds the image very well.  I like how we can barely see the blue, indigo and violet.', '2007-10-22 13:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187348, 602833, 80096, '<td valign="top">Lovely. 7</td>', 'Lovely. 7', '2007-10-22 13:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187349, 603225, 67152, '<td valign="top">Hi Yellow! Nice creative photo.  Great job of making a rainbow out of such attractive and interesting characters.   There is something about this image that is sooooo close to working great.  But there is is just ever so slightly not quite on the money.  I think it is the lighting. It seems that BIV side of the rainbow needs a bit more light to compensate for the darkness of the colors themselves as compared to the ROY side.</td>', 'Hi Yellow! Nice creative photo.  Great job of making a rainbow out of such attractive and interesting characters.   There is something about this image that is sooooo close to working great.  But there is is just ever so slightly not quite on the money.  I think it is the lighting. It seems that BIV side of the rainbow needs a bit more light to compensate for the darkness of the colors themselves as compared to the ROY side.', '2007-10-22 13:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
