(4188252, 602128, 3746, '<td valign="top">WOuld of loved this shot to of been taken outside, with maybe the feet in a puddle or something.. missed opportunity I feel.. still, works well. 7</td>', 'WOuld of loved this shot to of been taken outside, with maybe the feet in a puddle or something.. missed opportunity I feel.. still, works well. 7', '2007-10-22 20:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188257, 603046, 3746, '<td valign="top">seems like a hastily thrown together concept and shot. lighting is straight on and poor. You could of at least found a better backdrop to shoot the ciggy packet on. If you are trying to score well you really need to spend a bit more time and effort putting the shots together. 3</td>', 'seems like a hastily thrown together concept and shot. lighting is straight on and poor. You could of at least found a better backdrop to shoot the ciggy packet on. If you are trying to score well you really need to spend a bit more time and effort putting the shots together. 3', '2007-10-22 20:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188269, 602128, 80096, '<td valign="top">Cute. 7</td>', 'Cute. 7', '2007-10-22 20:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188281, 602868, 80096, '<td valign="top">I might have trimmed more off the lower portion but it works. 9</td>', 'I might have trimmed more off the lower portion but it works. 9', '2007-10-22 20:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188288, 603083, 3746, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot, I am thinking it MAY be slightly bending the rules, I have requested the SC get further info, but I am voting it as a 9 because its great, hope it passes validation!</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot, I am thinking it MAY be slightly bending the rules, I have requested the SC get further info, but I am voting it as a 9 because its great, hope it passes validation!', '2007-10-22 20:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188289, 603079, 80096, '<td valign="top">Kind of a grubby hat, lol...nice idea though.</td>', 'Kind of a grubby hat, lol...nice idea though.', '2007-10-22 20:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188292, 601688, 80096, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. 6</td>', 'Interesting effect. 6', '2007-10-22 20:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188293, 603095, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 7</td>', 'Very nice. 7', '2007-10-22 20:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188298, 603225, 3746, '<td valign="top">great idea - 8</td>', 'great idea - 8', '2007-10-22 20:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188300, 600656, 80096, '<td valign="top">Rainbow eyes, beautiful. 7</td>', 'Rainbow eyes, beautiful. 7', '2007-10-22 20:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188356, 602912, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and rainbow-like reflections.</td>', 'I like the composition and rainbow-like reflections.', '2007-10-22 20:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188362, 601822, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your creativity and concept. One nit-picky kind of thing...and I could be wrong - isn''t it ROYGBIV? Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo &amp; violet? Your yellow and orange seem to be switched. Not deducting points - just making an observation. I like the simplicity of your image as well. Would make a good photo for a notions advertisement.</td>', 'I like your creativity and concept. One nit-picky kind of thing...and I could be wrong - isn''t it ROYGBIV? Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo & violet? Your yellow and orange seem to be switched. Not deducting points - just making an observation. I like the simplicity of your image as well. Would make a good photo for a notions advertisement.', '2007-10-22 20:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188365, 603243, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - you definitely have the rainbow part down!My favorite part is actually the background. The distorted waves on the glass actually hurt my eyes to look at - very busy. I do like it - just can''t look at it for too long. Lol</td>', 'Wow - you definitely have the rainbow part down!My favorite part is actually the background. The distorted waves on the glass actually hurt my eyes to look at - very busy. I do like it - just can''t look at it for too long. Lol', '2007-10-22 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188368, 602495, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is cool - a "novel" idea :-D I like the composition and lighting. If anything, I wish the shadows behind the books were either stronger or not there altogether.</td>', 'Hey, this is cool - a "novel" idea :-D I like the composition and lighting. If anything, I wish the shadows behind the books were either stronger or not there altogether.', '2007-10-22 20:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188378, 603227, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m curious if there are other angles this might have been taken from that would make it even more interesting? The colors seems a little flat. Maybe additional contrast or if the light were stronger it would "pop" a bit more.</td>', 'I''m curious if there are other angles this might have been taken from that would make it even more interesting? The colors seems a little flat. Maybe additional contrast or if the light were stronger it would "pop" a bit more.', '2007-10-22 21:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188382, 603241, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, hah! ROFL tee hee hee. I love fun shots like this. This is what makes photography enjoyable for me. I don''t know too much about technical stuff - all I know is I like it alot and hope it does well in this challenge. 10 for fun and laughs</td>', 'Ha, ha, hah! ROFL tee hee hee. I love fun shots like this. This is what makes photography enjoyable for me. I don''t know too much about technical stuff - all I know is I like it alot and hope it does well in this challenge. 10 for fun and laughs', '2007-10-22 21:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188387, 603112, 41675, '<td valign="top">The grainy background keeps pulling my eyes away from the middle of your image - which I find the most interesting. I like the pastel rainbow colors.</td>', 'The grainy background keeps pulling my eyes away from the middle of your image - which I find the most interesting. I like the pastel rainbow colors.', '2007-10-22 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188394, 603078, 41675, '<td valign="top">Professionally creative. My first impression was this image belongs in a retro 60''s or 70''s magazine. The corners of the purple background are bit dark, but I''m sure this will do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Professionally creative. My first impression was this image belongs in a retro 60''s or 70''s magazine. The corners of the purple background are bit dark, but I''m sure this will do well in the challenge.', '2007-10-22 21:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188397, 603235, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fun abstract and good use of the CD''s for rainbow effect. In some abstract way they remind me of fish scales. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fun abstract and good use of the CD''s for rainbow effect. In some abstract way they remind me of fish scales. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-22 21:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188399, 602953, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your image. Nicely balanced and my focus stays on the rainbow. Reminds me a little bit of that rock band t-shirt...Led Zepplin?</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your image. Nicely balanced and my focus stays on the rainbow. Reminds me a little bit of that rock band t-shirt...Led Zepplin?', '2007-10-22 21:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188400, 602772, 3746, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.. nice natural shot. works well. 8</td>', 'I really like this one.. nice natural shot. works well. 8', '2007-10-22 21:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188403, 602746, 58247, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge. :-)</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge. :-)', '2007-10-22 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188408, 603083, 58247, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro and use of rainbow.</td>', 'Nice Macro and use of rainbow.', '2007-10-22 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188409, 603078, 58247, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this image, but must admit the eyelashes do bother me. However overall, it is a solid image.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this image, but must admit the eyelashes do bother me. However overall, it is a solid image.', '2007-10-22 21:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188410, 603240, 58247, '<td valign="top">Very nice clarity. The color and the eye are great!</td>', 'Very nice clarity. The color and the eye are great!', '2007-10-22 21:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188412, 602970, 41675, '<td valign="top">A pretty, natural rainbow. I like your composition and having the land at the bottom. I also like the fall colors of the trees. I''m looking forward to finding out where this is.</td>', 'A pretty, natural rainbow. I like your composition and having the land at the bottom. I also like the fall colors of the trees. I''m looking forward to finding out where this is.', '2007-10-22 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188418, 602290, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice double rainbow. For me, the red of the dirt is a good strong compliment and enhances the colors of the bottom rainbow. I also like the vertical format.</td>', 'Nice double rainbow. For me, the red of the dirt is a good strong compliment and enhances the colors of the bottom rainbow. I also like the vertical format.', '2007-10-22 21:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188421, 602529, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Your title makes me smile. I like your composition - good rainbow capture. Too bad there wasn''t small boat passing by for a bit of added interest.</td>', ':-) Your title makes me smile. I like your composition - good rainbow capture. Too bad there wasn''t small boat passing by for a bit of added interest.', '2007-10-22 21:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188423, 602497, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite thing about your image is the texture. It''s like I can almost literally feel the fibers.</td>', 'My favorite thing about your image is the texture. It''s like I can almost literally feel the fibers.', '2007-10-22 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188426, 603075, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, vividly bright rainbow. My eyes go right to that spot and even though it''s not exciting, I don''t mind the parking lot too much.</td>', 'Nice, vividly bright rainbow. My eyes go right to that spot and even though it''s not exciting, I don''t mind the parking lot too much.', '2007-10-22 21:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188430, 602735, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I like the ceiling of this building, my favorite part of your photo is the reflected colors on the interior right wall. I pretty much ignore the rest of the image because that one area is so interesting with its lines, shapes and colors.</td>', 'While I like the ceiling of this building, my favorite part of your photo is the reflected colors on the interior right wall. I pretty much ignore the rest of the image because that one area is so interesting with its lines, shapes and colors.', '2007-10-22 21:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188432, 603204, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first impression of your photo was that of a holiday/Christmas jewelry advertisement. All those sparklies make me think of diamonds and jewels. I like the abstract look.</td>', 'My first impression of your photo was that of a holiday/Christmas jewelry advertisement. All those sparklies make me think of diamonds and jewels. I like the abstract look.', '2007-10-22 21:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188437, 603231, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a neat viewpoint.Although the rainbow itself isn''t all that prominent, it''s a unique image.</td>', 'What a neat viewpoint.Although the rainbow itself isn''t all that prominent, it''s a unique image.', '2007-10-22 21:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188438, 603238, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, can''t believe how close that rainbow is.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Wow, can''t believe how close that rainbow is.  Very pretty.', '2007-10-22 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188441, 602427, 41675, '<td valign="top">A classic arced rainbow shot. I like the strong rainbow - it''s pretty to look at.</td>', 'A classic arced rainbow shot. I like the strong rainbow - it''s pretty to look at.', '2007-10-22 21:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188442, 602044, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors..The lighting is a bit to bright..maybe wait until morning or evening when the sun isn''t as harsh.</td>', 'Nice fall colors..The lighting is a bit to bright..maybe wait until morning or evening when the sun isn''t as harsh.', '2007-10-22 21:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188444, 602848, 41675, '<td valign="top">One of my top two favorites so far. I like the glass and don''t even mind the little scratches, dust, etc. For me, it adds to a feelig of the flower being trapped within.  I hope this does well in the challenge for you. Good luck.</td>', 'One of my top two favorites so far. I like the glass and don''t even mind the little scratches, dust, etc. For me, it adds to a feelig of the flower being trapped within.  I hope this does well in the challenge for you. Good luck.', '2007-10-22 21:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188446, 602306, 714, '<td valign="top">Looks like the pot of gold is just over those trees.  Very nice image and capture.</td>', 'Looks like the pot of gold is just over those trees.  Very nice image and capture.', '2007-10-22 21:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188447, 602451, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fun building to look at. I actually like the sailboat better than the rainbow. the sky seems overly or unnaturally dark blue to me.</td>', 'Fun building to look at. I actually like the sailboat better than the rainbow. the sky seems overly or unnaturally dark blue to me.', '2007-10-22 21:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188448, 603232, 714, '<td valign="top">Is that a face I see in the blue?  Awesome.</td>', 'Is that a face I see in the blue?  Awesome.', '2007-10-22 21:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188451, 603240, 714, '<td valign="top">This is very cool!  Love the colors..one thing that bugs me is the hair, I would have loved to see the whole eyebrow</td>', 'This is very cool!  Love the colors..one thing that bugs me is the hair, I would have loved to see the whole eyebrow', '2007-10-22 21:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188456, 602116, 41675, '<td valign="top">Until I saw your title, I kept searching for the stereotypical rainbow. For me, I like the top half of your image. The bottom half just isn''t as appealing to me. Perhaps because it''s mostly composed of the reflection or its overall darkness.</td>', 'Until I saw your title, I kept searching for the stereotypical rainbow. For me, I like the top half of your image. The bottom half just isn''t as appealing to me. Perhaps because it''s mostly composed of the reflection or its overall darkness.', '2007-10-22 21:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188458, 601688, 41675, '<td valign="top">This would make a good background element...or wrapping paper. I like the pastel rainbow colors. I''m curious as to what this would look like without that strong black border.</td>', 'This would make a good background element...or wrapping paper. I like the pastel rainbow colors. I''m curious as to what this would look like without that strong black border.', '2007-10-22 21:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188459, 603031, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice..the red seems a bit bright though.  Takes away from the rest of the colors.</td>', 'Very nice..the red seems a bit bright though.  Takes away from the rest of the colors.', '2007-10-22 21:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188463, 603233, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, with a less wrinkled background and a bit better letting, I would have scored this better. I the creative idea for your setup though.</td>', 'For me, with a less wrinkled background and a bit better letting, I would have scored this better. I the creative idea for your setup though.', '2007-10-22 21:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188466, 603225, 714, '<td valign="top">love the tall guys pants..hahahaha!!!!  Looks like you guys had fun shooting this.</td>', 'love the tall guys pants..hahahaha!!!!  Looks like you guys had fun shooting this.', '2007-10-22 21:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188468, 603046, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your lighting is very harsh and the background is too destracting. Perhaps a solid black or white background would be better. Also, think about using the rule of thirds for your main element and not having it "dead" center in your photo.</td>', 'For me, your lighting is very harsh and the background is too destracting. Perhaps a solid black or white background would be better. Also, think about using the rule of thirds for your main element and not having it "dead" center in your photo.', '2007-10-22 21:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188469, 602202, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cool! This would make a good postcard for wherever this was taken. I especially like the light on the field in the background.</td>', 'Cool! This would make a good postcard for wherever this was taken. I especially like the light on the field in the background.', '2007-10-22 21:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188471, 602034, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. Your image makes me think of Christmas and caroling. I like the angle and composition.</td>', 'I like your idea. Your image makes me think of Christmas and caroling. I like the angle and composition.', '2007-10-22 21:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188473, 603150, 714, '<td valign="top">those things are huge..would have made a good shot for the macro challenge.</td>', 'those things are huge..would have made a good shot for the macro challenge.', '2007-10-22 21:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188474, 602006, 714, '<td valign="top">oh yeah..this is my fav.  Looks very peaceful.  Love the colors.</td>', 'oh yeah..this is my fav.  Looks very peaceful.  Love the colors.', '2007-10-22 21:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188475, 602106, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle - hope he makes it through November without making it onto an American dinner table. :-) As for a rainbow of colors? Ehhh...bit of a stretch to me.</td>', 'Interesting angle - hope he makes it through November without making it onto an American dinner table. :-) As for a rainbow of colors? Ehhh...bit of a stretch to me.', '2007-10-22 21:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188476, 602848, 714, '<td valign="top">interesting shot ..love it.</td>', 'interesting shot ..love it.', '2007-10-22 21:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188485, 602541, 714, '<td valign="top">Looks like a halo atop that cross..very nice effect here.</td>', 'Looks like a halo atop that cross..very nice effect here.', '2007-10-22 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188486, 602820, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the tight composition of your image. Good natural lighting. A pretty rainbow image.</td>', 'I like the tight composition of your image. Good natural lighting. A pretty rainbow image.', '2007-10-22 21:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188487, 601795, 714, '<td valign="top">Love the soft colors in the rainbow with the white of the snow.</td>', 'Love the soft colors in the rainbow with the white of the snow.', '2007-10-22 21:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188491, 602833, 714, '<td valign="top">Another fav photo in this challenge.  Love the simplicity.</td>', 'Another fav photo in this challenge.  Love the simplicity.', '2007-10-22 21:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188500, 602909, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. Some areas on the glass look a little...odd. Specifically the bottom left area of the glass between the purple and darker purple/blue and the right hand side of the glass along the red edge.</td>', 'I like your idea. Some areas on the glass look a little...odd. Specifically the bottom left area of the glass between the purple and darker purple/blue and the right hand side of the glass along the red edge.', '2007-10-22 21:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188504, 603095, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fun and free-spirited - your photo makes me smile. I like the background - it''s a good compliment and doesn''t distract. I don''t even mind the blurriness. I hope this is in the top ten. Good luck.</td>', 'Fun and free-spirited - your photo makes me smile. I like the background - it''s a good compliment and doesn''t distract. I don''t even mind the blurriness. I hope this is in the top ten. Good luck.', '2007-10-22 21:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188505, 603241, 714, '<td valign="top">Wonder what her milk looks like? :-/</td>', 'Wonder what her milk looks like? :-/', '2007-10-22 21:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188516, 602992, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I would have scored this higher if the handle were in the back and if the light wasn''t so harsh. I like the closeup of your composition.</td>', 'For me, I would have scored this higher if the handle were in the back and if the light wasn''t so harsh. I like the closeup of your composition.', '2007-10-22 21:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188518, 603037, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition here. Almost lacks contrast in the bottom but than it is to bright ..not sure how you took this ..would be interesting to find out. Maybe there is a way to fix it.</td>', 'Very nice composition here. Almost lacks contrast in the bottom but than it is to bright ..not sure how you took this ..would be interesting to find out. Maybe there is a way to fix it.', '2007-10-22 21:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188525, 602428, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the droplets themselves, it''s the vertical lines coming off from them I find distracting</td>', 'I like the droplets themselves, it''s the vertical lines coming off from them I find distracting', '2007-10-22 22:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188528, 602872, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, not too much of a rainbow, but I do find the texture interesting.</td>', 'For me, not too much of a rainbow, but I do find the texture interesting.', '2007-10-22 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188538, 603225, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Creative and original. I like it. Well done. This would be a good advertisement for a gap or Old Navy type store.</td>', ':-) Creative and original. I like it. Well done. This would be a good advertisement for a gap or Old Navy type store.', '2007-10-22 22:05:21.000000', NULL, 1);
