(4189213, 603079, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your choice of background doesn''t work well. Your image looks a bit grainy too. I do like the idea of using the hat though. Perhaps a solid black background or showing the entire hat would be more effective?</td>', 'For me, your choice of background doesn''t work well. Your image looks a bit grainy too. I do like the idea of using the hat though. Perhaps a solid black background or showing the entire hat would be more effective?', '2007-10-23 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189216, 603218, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. The slinky-like toy in the upper left is distracting, otherwise a fun photo and I like the pastel colors.</td>', 'I like your idea. The slinky-like toy in the upper left is distracting, otherwise a fun photo and I like the pastel colors.', '2007-10-23 09:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189217, 601901, 41675, '<td valign="top">On one hand I like the desaturation, on the other hand, I wish the umbrella itself wasn''t desaturated to make it stand out more. I do like how the man is "peeking" out.</td>', 'On one hand I like the desaturation, on the other hand, I wish the umbrella itself wasn''t desaturated to make it stand out more. I do like how the man is "peeking" out.', '2007-10-23 09:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
