(4193264, 603241, 5746, '<td valign="top">I don''t have any idea how did you do it, but it''s my winner from the start :) Simply great! The concept, the composition, the colours. Fabulous. 10.</td>', 'I don''t have any idea how did you do it, but it''s my winner from the start :) Simply great! The concept, the composition, the colours. Fabulous. 10.', '2007-10-24 17:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
