(4194591, 602987, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect I am failing to see what it was you were aiming for here.  I like the way the veins of the leaf are magnified by the water drop, but don''t feel the photo is enhanced by the lighting. The title, I''m afraid. has gone right over my head.</td>', 'I suspect I am failing to see what it was you were aiming for here.  I like the way the veins of the leaf are magnified by the water drop, but don''t feel the photo is enhanced by the lighting. The title, I''m afraid. has gone right over my head.', '2007-10-25 08:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
