(4194593, 602016, 67258, '<td valign="top">i have no idea what this is, but it certainly makes for an interesting and visually stimulating abstract image.</td>', 'i have no idea what this is, but it certainly makes for an interesting and visually stimulating abstract image.', '2007-10-25 08:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194598, 602495, 67258, '<td valign="top">The idea is a good one, but needs a little more attention to pull it off entirely successfully.  Personally, I would prefer to see more negative space to the top of the frame and a rather tighter framing to the sides, so that the ends of the shelf aren''t visible.  the shadows are somewhat distracting, but I can''t give you any practical advice here, as I am a complete ingnoramous as far as artificial lighting goes.</td>', 'The idea is a good one, but needs a little more attention to pull it off entirely successfully.  Personally, I would prefer to see more negative space to the top of the frame and a rather tighter framing to the sides, so that the ends of the shelf aren''t visible.  the shadows are somewhat distracting, but I can''t give you any practical advice here, as I am a complete ingnoramous as far as artificial lighting goes.', '2007-10-25 08:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194604, 603238, 67258, '<td valign="top">You have caught some gorgeous light on the headland that we get a glimpse of through the trees - I wish we could see a little more of it!</td>', 'You have caught some gorgeous light on the headland that we get a glimpse of through the trees - I wish we could see a little more of it!', '2007-10-25 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194610, 602106, 67258, '<td valign="top">For me this is a bit of  stretch for this challenge.  The photo seems a little static, compositionally - subjectively, I would prefer the turkey to be in partial profile, or if it is stare out of the shot, to have a little more space.</td>', 'For me this is a bit of  stretch for this challenge.  The photo seems a little static, compositionally - subjectively, I would prefer the turkey to be in partial profile, or if it is stare out of the shot, to have a little more space.', '2007-10-25 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194616, 602427, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super rainbow, and well done for capturing it.  the photograph does, though, need a little more work to make it a success.  There is visible haloing along the sky line, and there appear to be reflections, as though the photo was taken through a slightly dirty window.</td>', 'A super rainbow, and well done for capturing it.  the photograph does, though, need a little more work to make it a success.  There is visible haloing along the sky line, and there appear to be reflections, as though the photo was taken through a slightly dirty window.', '2007-10-25 08:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
