(4194903, 602803, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of shallow DOF.  the colors are really vibrant and the composition is solid</td>', 'nice use of shallow DOF.  the colors are really vibrant and the composition is solid', '2007-10-25 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194906, 602987, 67152, '<td valign="top">this is very cool - the darkness of the image, the spooky glow from the greens and reds, the brightness of the rainbow on the drop, and the neat textures all work</td>', 'this is very cool - the darkness of the image, the spooky glow from the greens and reds, the brightness of the rainbow on the drop, and the neat textures all work', '2007-10-25 11:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194909, 603095, 67152, '<td valign="top">This one really jumps for joy.  The background colors and textures work really well.  The focus on the girl''s face, the brightness of the rainbow, and the bright white of her top make this a special image.  My only negative comment is that I really don''t like the blur in her legs and feet.  The blur in the rainbow streamer works great, however.</td>', 'This one really jumps for joy.  The background colors and textures work really well.  The focus on the girl''s face, the brightness of the rainbow, and the bright white of her top make this a special image.  My only negative comment is that I really don''t like the blur in her legs and feet.  The blur in the rainbow streamer works great, however.', '2007-10-25 11:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194916, 601901, 79720, '<td valign="top">I love this candid, very nicely done. I might have played a touch with the selective colours, but a very nice feel none-the-less. 9.</td>', 'I love this candid, very nicely done. I might have played a touch with the selective colours, but a very nice feel none-the-less. 9.', '2007-10-25 11:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194917, 602541, 79720, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky! Nicely done.</td>', 'Dramatic sky! Nicely done.', '2007-10-25 11:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194918, 602953, 79720, '<td valign="top">Oh, my. I tried it, I did. It didn''t work out for me. Congratulations.</td>', 'Oh, my. I tried it, I did. It didn''t work out for me. Congratulations.', '2007-10-25 11:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194919, 602116, 79720, '<td valign="top">Too bad there''s no actual rainbow, but a nice image.</td>', 'Too bad there''s no actual rainbow, but a nice image.', '2007-10-25 11:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194921, 603241, 79720, '<td valign="top">What on Earth? Poor cow.</td>', 'What on Earth? Poor cow.', '2007-10-25 11:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194929, 602868, 51222, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.', '2007-10-25 11:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194931, 602970, 45375, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but more color in the rainbow would be amazing, as it is now it''s very hard to see</td>', 'nice composition, but more color in the rainbow would be amazing, as it is now it''s very hard to see', '2007-10-25 11:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194955, 603238, 71000, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2007-10-25 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194977, 602598, 55956, '<td valign="top">good image but in every challenge there is always one image similar to this.</td>', 'good image but in every challenge there is always one image similar to this.', '2007-10-25 12:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194980, 603241, 55956, '<td valign="top">probably intensive use of selective hue/saturation. interesting and original ,  amusing solution. 10</td>', 'probably intensive use of selective hue/saturation. interesting and original ,  amusing solution. 10', '2007-10-25 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194982, 602006, 55956, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. perfect composition and lighting. 10</td>', 'I really like this image. perfect composition and lighting. 10', '2007-10-25 12:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4194986, 603233, 55956, '<td valign="top">not bad, too much dark in lower side. The background is bent. 5</td>', 'not bad, too much dark in lower side. The background is bent. 5', '2007-10-25 12:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195045, 603231, 78196, '<td valign="top">The feet in the shot are necessary but not particularly attractive. In many ways it''s a shame we can''t see more from this unique birds-eye view. Perhaps you could have been a little more imaginative with the composition.</td>', 'The feet in the shot are necessary but not particularly attractive. In many ways it''s a shame we can''t see more from this unique birds-eye view. Perhaps you could have been a little more imaginative with the composition.', '2007-10-25 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195046, 603040, 78196, '<td valign="top">Pretty and bright but slightly oversharpened (jaggies in evidence here).</td>', 'Pretty and bright but slightly oversharpened (jaggies in evidence here).', '2007-10-25 12:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195047, 603075, 78196, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely bright rainbow and the sky is fairly dramatic, but parking lots don''t make the best foregrounds. Looks like a little walk might have got you a better view.</td>', 'That''s a lovely bright rainbow and the sky is fairly dramatic, but parking lots don''t make the best foregrounds. Looks like a little walk might have got you a better view.', '2007-10-25 12:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195049, 603117, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well the colours of the rainbow are probably all here but it''s a push for the challenge description. Amazing lobby though and the composition is strong.</td>', 'Well the colours of the rainbow are probably all here but it''s a push for the challenge description. Amazing lobby though and the composition is strong.', '2007-10-25 13:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195050, 602495, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice. Couple of things to bear in mind - the shadows above the books are not especially attractive and in general this lacks a little bit of sharpness.</td>', 'Nice. Couple of things to bear in mind - the shadows above the books are not especially attractive and in general this lacks a little bit of sharpness.', '2007-10-25 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195052, 602427, 78196, '<td valign="top">A nice rainbow but let down by the lack of sharpness and high saturation.</td>', 'A nice rainbow but let down by the lack of sharpness and high saturation.', '2007-10-25 13:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195054, 602006, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed. I think you could have pushed the saturation up a bit though, it does seem a little on the dull side.</td>', 'Very nice indeed. I think you could have pushed the saturation up a bit though, it does seem a little on the dull side.', '2007-10-25 13:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195058, 603150, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice. I only wish the pink jack were in focus, the lack of sharpness there bothers me slightly. But the DoF is otherwise very well controlled indeed.</td>', 'Nice. I only wish the pink jack were in focus, the lack of sharpness there bothers me slightly. But the DoF is otherwise very well controlled indeed.', '2007-10-25 13:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195061, 602100, 78196, '<td valign="top">Composition ok. DoF needs to be either much deeper or much shallower for a good photographic effect. The slight blur here is not particularly attractive.</td>', 'Composition ok. DoF needs to be either much deeper or much shallower for a good photographic effect. The slight blur here is not particularly attractive.', '2007-10-25 13:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195241, 603095, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super capture, as your title says, so full of the joy of life,  Excellent work, and easily my favourite of the challenge.</td>', 'Super capture, as your title says, so full of the joy of life,  Excellent work, and easily my favourite of the challenge.', '2007-10-25 14:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195245, 602006, 67258, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous - I can almost hear the silence!  In my top two of the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous - I can almost hear the silence!  In my top two of the challenge.', '2007-10-25 14:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195394, 602746, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very bright, vibrant colors and great lighting!  I find the glitter a tad bit distracting, but I also have to conceede that it adds a little bit of fun to the shot :-)  Great job!</td>', 'Very bright, vibrant colors and great lighting!  I find the glitter a tad bit distracting, but I also have to conceede that it adds a little bit of fun to the shot :-)  Great job!', '2007-10-25 16:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195397, 602953, 35513, '<td valign="top">The angles really make this a nice shot.  The light patterns help to draw the eye through the whole piece...nicely done.</td>', 'The angles really make this a nice shot.  The light patterns help to draw the eye through the whole piece...nicely done.', '2007-10-25 16:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195399, 602868, 35513, '<td valign="top">I now want an umbrella like this :-)  Love the minimalistic feel of this shot.  Great job!</td>', 'I now want an umbrella like this :-)  Love the minimalistic feel of this shot.  Great job!', '2007-10-25 16:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195401, 603040, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image!  Simple idea, but well carried out.</td>', 'Nice clean image!  Simple idea, but well carried out.', '2007-10-25 16:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195404, 602833, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I love the reflections in the water droplets.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I love the reflections in the water droplets.', '2007-10-25 16:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195406, 602044, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the colors of the leaves.  The exposure looks very bright on the ground though...was this shot with you facing into the sun?</td>', 'Good job capturing the colors of the leaves.  The exposure looks very bright on the ground though...was this shot with you facing into the sun?', '2007-10-25 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195411, 602495, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!  You''ve got me thinking about reorganizing my bookshelf now :-)</td>', 'Cute idea!  You''ve got me thinking about reorganizing my bookshelf now :-)', '2007-10-25 16:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195416, 602956, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice set up on this shot..must have taken some time!  I think maybe my eye would flow through the shot more if the skittles in the front were in focus, with the "pot" slightly blurred.</td>', 'Nice set up on this shot..must have taken some time!  I think maybe my eye would flow through the shot more if the skittles in the front were in focus, with the "pot" slightly blurred.', '2007-10-25 16:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195418, 602987, 35513, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  I''m really curious to know how you lit this!</td>', 'Neat shot!  I''m really curious to know how you lit this!', '2007-10-25 16:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195429, 603083, 35513, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic!! Only nitpick would be that the catchlight in the eye is rather large in relation to the entire shot.</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic!! Only nitpick would be that the catchlight in the eye is rather large in relation to the entire shot.', '2007-10-25 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195542, 603083, 15832, '<td valign="top">The best picture in this challenge!!!  Congrats.. Really creativ!</td>', 'The best picture in this challenge!!!  Congrats.. Really creativ!', '2007-10-25 17:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195693, 602598, 28172, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I pick this to win a blue! 10 from me.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I pick this to win a blue! 10 from me.', '2007-10-25 18:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195738, 602958, 20608, '<td valign="top">So who ate all the purple ones?</td>', 'So who ate all the purple ones?', '2007-10-25 18:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195765, 603095, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hi Lesley (im 99% sure) if not, its a compliment dont worry -9-</td>', 'Hi Lesley (im 99% sure) if not, its a compliment dont worry -9-', '2007-10-25 18:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195766, 602306, 52472, '<td valign="top">Nice! The rainbow stands out clearly from an interesting sky, which is quite rare. I would have cropped the bottom off and kept just the thin strip of green grass.</td>', 'Nice! The rainbow stands out clearly from an interesting sky, which is quite rare. I would have cropped the bottom off and kept just the thin strip of green grass.', '2007-10-25 18:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195775, 602652, 52472, '<td valign="top">Nice make-up, but I don''t like the crop. An eye in the dead center looks a bit like the freemason logo, it''s kind of disturbing.</td>', 'Nice make-up, but I don''t like the crop. An eye in the dead center looks a bit like the freemason logo, it''s kind of disturbing.', '2007-10-25 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4195802, 603083, 52472, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! You should have used a blue pencil, because it''s the colour you should get fort that shot...</td>', 'Fantastic! You should have used a blue pencil, because it''s the colour you should get fort that shot...', '2007-10-25 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196020, 603083, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. It reminds me of an ad for color digital copiers - and bringing color to life kind of thing. Great post-processing. One of my top three favorites. Best of luck.</td>', 'Very cool image. It reminds me of an ad for color digital copiers - and bringing color to life kind of thing. Great post-processing. One of my top three favorites. Best of luck.', '2007-10-25 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196022, 602006, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your composition. A really good fall landscape.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your composition. A really good fall landscape.', '2007-10-25 22:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196027, 602496, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the flag and the colors on it. The background is a little bland for me, but good use of natural lighting.</td>', 'I like the flag and the colors on it. The background is a little bland for me, but good use of natural lighting.', '2007-10-25 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196039, 602306, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, the foreground is a little washed out,but I really like the sky and rainbow.</td>', 'To me, the foreground is a little washed out,but I really like the sky and rainbow.', '2007-10-25 22:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196045, 601015, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) I really like your image. It''s different, refreshing, nicely composed. Perhaps the lighting is a bit harsh around the honey jar, but there''s something about your photo that makes me smile. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', ':-) I really like your image. It''s different, refreshing, nicely composed. Perhaps the lighting is a bit harsh around the honey jar, but there''s something about your photo that makes me smile. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-25 22:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196051, 603165, 41675, '<td valign="top">Saratoga as in Saratoga Springs, NY? If so - how cool!!! If not, it makes me think of home. I like the composition and angle of the bottles. I like the lighting and the faint mesh pattern adds a nice, yet not overpowering texture. Aside from sentimental reasons, I hope this finishes in the top ten! Good luck.</td>', 'Saratoga as in Saratoga Springs, NY? If so - how cool!!! If not, it makes me think of home. I like the composition and angle of the bottles. I like the lighting and the faint mesh pattern adds a nice, yet not overpowering texture. Aside from sentimental reasons, I hope this finishes in the top ten! Good luck.', '2007-10-25 22:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196069, 602100, 20651, '<td valign="top">I like how saturated the colors are.  Perhaps a different angle would have added interest?</td>', 'I like how saturated the colors are.  Perhaps a different angle would have added interest?', '2007-10-25 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196072, 602833, 20651, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is a really cool shot.  I love the use of depth of field.  Very creative!</td>', 'Wow... this is a really cool shot.  I love the use of depth of field.  Very creative!', '2007-10-25 22:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196108, 602495, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice interpretation of the subject. I like the subtle shadow and the border complements it well.</td>', 'A nice interpretation of the subject. I like the subtle shadow and the border complements it well.', '2007-10-25 22:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196110, 603126, 83313, '<td valign="top">good capture of a natural rainbow, there seems to be a color cast.</td>', 'good capture of a natural rainbow, there seems to be a color cast.', '2007-10-25 22:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196115, 602519, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and the background works well.</td>', 'Good lighting and the background works well.', '2007-10-25 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196116, 602772, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good composition, it draws my eye up to the woman.</td>', 'Good composition, it draws my eye up to the woman.', '2007-10-25 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196121, 603137, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice glow from the lighting. Does not seem as detailed as I am trying to see in it. It''s probably just the scaling down to 640 pixels lost a lot.</td>', 'Nice glow from the lighting. Does not seem as detailed as I am trying to see in it. It''s probably just the scaling down to 640 pixels lost a lot.', '2007-10-25 23:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196124, 602836, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice and clear.</td>', 'Good composition, nice and clear.', '2007-10-25 23:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196127, 602541, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit more subtle than most of the entries in this challenge. The clouds seem to be flowing out from the steeple. Some visual artifacts visible on the steeple, probably from trying to bring out the shadow details.</td>', 'A bit more subtle than most of the entries in this challenge. The clouds seem to be flowing out from the steeple. Some visual artifacts visible on the steeple, probably from trying to bring out the shadow details.', '2007-10-25 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196133, 602909, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, unfortunately, some slight skewing hurts it.</td>', 'Nice, unfortunately, some slight skewing hurts it.', '2007-10-25 23:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196140, 603232, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks good. I''d like to know how you set this one up.</td>', 'Looks good. I''d like to know how you set this one up.', '2007-10-25 23:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196146, 602746, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a child of the 60''s, but looks like one... a unique portrait.</td>', 'Not a child of the 60''s, but looks like one... a unique portrait.', '2007-10-25 23:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196150, 601901, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good, but the background distracts me from the subject a little.</td>', 'Good, but the background distracts me from the subject a little.', '2007-10-25 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196151, 602848, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the semi-abstract look.</td>', 'I like the semi-abstract look.', '2007-10-25 23:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196155, 602100, 83313, '<td valign="top">a good portrait of this street, well balanced, but it does not impact me much.</td>', 'a good portrait of this street, well balanced, but it does not impact me much.', '2007-10-25 23:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196160, 603243, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some slight skewing visible at the rim, otherwise a good one. (But I think it''s making me dizzy...)</td>', 'Some slight skewing visible at the rim, otherwise a good one. (But I think it''s making me dizzy...)', '2007-10-25 23:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196164, 602833, 83313, '<td valign="top">Once again, I am impressed with the use of water drops in a photo. Another for my faves list.</td>', 'Once again, I am impressed with the use of water drops in a photo. Another for my faves list.', '2007-10-25 23:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196168, 602202, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice framing of an impressive subject.</td>', 'A nice framing of an impressive subject.', '2007-10-25 23:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196171, 602773, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good capture, Nice color and DOF, but I''m not finding anything exceptional in it.</td>', 'A good capture, Nice color and DOF, but I''m not finding anything exceptional in it.', '2007-10-25 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196175, 603233, 83313, '<td valign="top">Isn''t St. Paddy''s day way off? I think some different lighting would have helped it some.</td>', 'Isn''t St. Paddy''s day way off? I think some different lighting would have helped it some.', '2007-10-25 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196176, 603095, 83313, '<td valign="top">A fun pic, and another one for my favorites list.</td>', 'A fun pic, and another one for my favorites list.', '2007-10-25 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196178, 602987, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very unique view of this leaf. Subtle, yet also strong colors.</td>', 'A very unique view of this leaf. Subtle, yet also strong colors.', '2007-10-25 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196182, 602956, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I think the lighting is too dead on front and center. Moving the lights might give it some more interest, especially on the glass bowl.</td>', 'A good idea, but I think the lighting is too dead on front and center. Moving the lights might give it some more interest, especially on the glass bowl.', '2007-10-25 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196185, 603225, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good approach to this subject. Did this just occur on it''s own, or did you have them dress in the right colors?</td>', 'A good approach to this subject. Did this just occur on it''s own, or did you have them dress in the right colors?', '2007-10-25 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196188, 602496, 83313, '<td valign="top">A Nice wavy look in a perfect sky.</td>', 'A Nice wavy look in a perfect sky.', '2007-10-25 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196194, 603079, 83313, '<td valign="top">looks like some camera shake or blurriness. I''m not sure if cutting it off where you did at the bottom of the hat works for me. My impression is that this was not a shot you staged, but something that you had to snap when it happened.</td>', 'looks like some camera shake or blurriness. I''m not sure if cutting it off where you did at the bottom of the hat works for me. My impression is that this was not a shot you staged, but something that you had to snap when it happened.', '2007-10-25 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196196, 602590, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can''t argue with that title!</td>', 'I can''t argue with that title!', '2007-10-25 23:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196200, 602109, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors on this, but there''s not a lot of Depth Of Field. to be fair, this was probably tough to capture at just the right moment.</td>', 'Wonderful colors on this, but there''s not a lot of Depth Of Field. to be fair, this was probably tough to capture at just the right moment.', '2007-10-25 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196202, 600656, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good perspective and lighting.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good perspective and lighting.', '2007-10-25 23:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196204, 602497, 83313, '<td valign="top">simple, but strong.</td>', 'simple, but strong.', '2007-10-25 23:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196206, 602016, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like some dip with my chips...</td>', 'I like some dip with my chips...', '2007-10-25 23:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196208, 603138, 83313, '<td valign="top">The rainbow is very subtle, but it''s there.</td>', 'The rainbow is very subtle, but it''s there.', '2007-10-25 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196212, 602495, 51597, '<td valign="top">Good idea.. nice tonal composition ..</td>', 'Good idea.. nice tonal composition ..', '2007-10-25 23:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196214, 603126, 51597, '<td valign="top">Stormy and dramatic!!</td>', 'Stormy and dramatic!!', '2007-10-25 23:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196215, 602868, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I like the patterns, and the composition leads me from the upper right corner down to the umbrella. A fave.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I like the patterns, and the composition leads me from the upper right corner down to the umbrella. A fave.', '2007-10-25 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196216, 602496, 51597, '<td valign="top">Well done~</td>', 'Well done~', '2007-10-25 23:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196219, 602451, 83313, '<td valign="top">The upward looking perspective seems forced, and the colors seem a little washed out to me.</td>', 'The upward looking perspective seems forced, and the colors seem a little washed out to me.', '2007-10-25 23:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196220, 602106, 51597, '<td valign="top">Yikes!! Kind of gross...Well done!!</td>', 'Yikes!! Kind of gross...Well done!!', '2007-10-25 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
