(4196414, 603037, 75034, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the composition but I would offer one thing, the focus looks a little off for me maybe a little soft.</td>', 'I like the shot and the composition but I would offer one thing, the focus looks a little off for me maybe a little soft.', '2007-10-26 01:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196415, 602427, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the rainbow. It looks to me that you may have over saturated a little as the rest of the shot has really harsh tones and colour.</td>', 'Nice capture of the rainbow. It looks to me that you may have over saturated a little as the rest of the shot has really harsh tones and colour.', '2007-10-26 01:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196417, 602735, 75034, '<td valign="top">I like that this is a rainbow of colour and not just rainbow colours. It is nice to see people use different approaches to challenges.</td>', 'I like that this is a rainbow of colour and not just rainbow colours. It is nice to see people use different approaches to challenges.', '2007-10-26 01:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196418, 600582, 75034, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if I would see a shot from here. Every time we go there is always a rainbow glowing for all to see if you just get in the right spot.<br/> <br/>The colours are rich and full, you have a nice shot here.</td>', 'I was wondering if I would see a shot from here. Every time we go there is always a rainbow glowing for all to see if you just get in the right spot. The colours are rich and full, you have a nice shot here.', '2007-10-26 01:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196419, 603083, 75034, '<td valign="top">Now this is so far outside the box, your not even in the same room as the box. It is great to see this kind of approach to this challenge. It is very creative and has so much going for it. Thank goodness this was in advanced editing it allowed you to be totally creative and bring us this wonderful image.<br/> <br/>I love the focus it is spot on and the contrast is beautiful. This has a welcome feel to it and the use of colour pulls us in. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Now this is so far outside the box, your not even in the same room as the box. It is great to see this kind of approach to this challenge. It is very creative and has so much going for it. Thank goodness this was in advanced editing it allowed you to be totally creative and bring us this wonderful image. I love the focus it is spot on and the contrast is beautiful. This has a welcome feel to it and the use of colour pulls us in. Very nicely done.', '2007-10-26 01:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196420, 603227, 75034, '<td valign="top">You will never get lost when you have a beakon like that in your neighbourhood. It must be great fun to give directions to new people, you can send them by the school just for fun. "Now turn left just past the round rainbow coloured school." I''m laughing just thinking about it.</td>', 'You will never get lost when you have a beakon like that in your neighbourhood. It must be great fun to give directions to new people, you can send them by the school just for fun. "Now turn left just past the round rainbow coloured school." I''m laughing just thinking about it.', '2007-10-26 01:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196421, 603046, 75034, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to this challenge. Do they burn colour smoke too.</td>', 'Interesting approach to this challenge. Do they burn colour smoke too.', '2007-10-26 01:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196431, 602496, 75034, '<td valign="top">I have a shot that is similar to this in my portfolio. It is nice that people can have an open mind about this and I hope you do well with it.</td>', 'I have a shot that is similar to this in my portfolio. It is nice that people can have an open mind about this and I hope you do well with it.', '2007-10-26 01:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196438, 602034, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice candle rainbow, it''s a first for me and has opened my eyes for a new way to look at candle flames.</td>', 'Nice candle rainbow, it''s a first for me and has opened my eyes for a new way to look at candle flames.', '2007-10-26 01:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196494, 602746, 75034, '<td valign="top">Now Judi when I was a kid my mother told me I was never to write,draw,colour,paint,use markers,food colouring, glue,sparkles or dye on my person. You are breaking all of my mothers rules with your kids and husband. You are so cool can I come and live at your house:-}<br/> <br/>As usual your daughter is beautiful and classic in pose. The approach you have taken is wonderful and it''s easy to see why you use your family as your models. If you look in your information you said you live in the middle of nowhere:-} Just tossing you a line, they are all wonderful and you have a lot to be proud of.<br/> <br/>Everything about your shot is wonderful from the subject right down to the use of bokeh. Great work as always and I wish you the best of luck with what should be a clear choice for one of the top three.</td>', 'Now Judi when I was a kid my mother told me I was never to write,draw,colour,paint,use markers,food colouring, glue,sparkles or dye on my person. You are breaking all of my mothers rules with your kids and husband. You are so cool can I come and live at your house:-} As usual your daughter is beautiful and classic in pose. The approach you have taken is wonderful and it''s easy to see why you use your family as your models. If you look in your information you said you live in the middle of nowhere:-} Just tossing you a line, they are all wonderful and you have a lot to be proud of. Everything about your shot is wonderful from the subject right down to the use of bokeh. Great work as always and I wish you the best of luck with what should be a clear choice for one of the top three.', '2007-10-26 01:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
