(4197916, 603031, 68256, '<td valign="top">This took me a little while to "get" it, but it is such a strong composition and is so beautiful that I just kept staring...I love the positioning of the horizon and the deep blue sky providing balance.  Great job.  PS, I voted a 9 on this a couple of days ago and I''m just now commenting....</td>', 'This took me a little while to "get" it, but it is such a strong composition and is so beautiful that I just kept staring...I love the positioning of the horizon and the deep blue sky providing balance.  Great job.  PS, I voted a 9 on this a couple of days ago and I''m just now commenting....', '2007-10-26 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197919, 602397, 68256, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of really cool portraits in this challenge which I didn''t expect to see....this is one of them.  Great job with everything...8</td>', 'There are a lot of really cool portraits in this challenge which I didn''t expect to see....this is one of them.  Great job with everything...8', '2007-10-26 17:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197929, 602495, 68256, '<td valign="top">I voted an 8 on this a couple of days ago, but now that I''m back to comment, this really deserves better.  I typically don''t like dividing photos in the center like this, but because the wall is a different color top/bottom, it really works well.  Of course the idea is totally awesome and now I can''t get the Reading Rainbow song out of my head!  bumping to 10 and my blue :)</td>', 'I voted an 8 on this a couple of days ago, but now that I''m back to comment, this really deserves better.  I typically don''t like dividing photos in the center like this, but because the wall is a different color top/bottom, it really works well.  Of course the idea is totally awesome and now I can''t get the Reading Rainbow song out of my head!  bumping to 10 and my blue :)', '2007-10-26 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197930, 601901, 43565, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  I think I would have liked it better with just the umbrella in color, or even the man and umbrella.  5</td>', 'A good idea.  I think I would have liked it better with just the umbrella in color, or even the man and umbrella.  5', '2007-10-26 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197934, 602306, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I gave this an 8 with my initial voting, but the colors and composition are so wonderful that it deserves a 9.  It is a great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I gave this an 8 with my initial voting, but the colors and composition are so wonderful that it deserves a 9.  It is a great shot.', '2007-10-26 17:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4197941, 602541, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow, totally awesome capture!  I do wish there were a little more space at the top above the cross, but that is my only "nitpick"..bumping to 9</td>', 'Wow, totally awesome capture!  I do wish there were a little more space at the top above the cross, but that is my only "nitpick"..bumping to 9', '2007-10-26 17:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
