(4197952, 602746, 68256, '<td valign="top">Fabulous portrait!  It is such a pleasant surprise to see these creative rainbow portraits in this challenge.  I don''t think I''ve seen one yet I didn''t like.  Why the solomn face though?  I think happy thoughts when I think rainbow :)  8</td>', 'Fabulous portrait!  It is such a pleasant surprise to see these creative rainbow portraits in this challenge.  I don''t think I''ve seen one yet I didn''t like.  Why the solomn face though?  I think happy thoughts when I think rainbow :)  8', '2007-10-26 17:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
