(4198241, 602958, 66952, '<td valign="top">Lotsa skittles in this challenge. Who''da thunk it? Focus and lighting are pretty good. Maybe the composition would be better if it weren''t so centered and straight up and down.</td>', 'Lotsa skittles in this challenge. Who''da thunk it? Focus and lighting are pretty good. Maybe the composition would be better if it weren''t so centered and straight up and down.', '2007-10-26 20:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
