(4198252, 603126, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbow. Compositionally, it''s a good use of the rule of thirds. Technically, though, the top of the clouds are completely blown out, and the colors on the ground are a bit strange. So overall, a mixed bag.</td>', 'Nice rainbow. Compositionally, it''s a good use of the rule of thirds. Technically, though, the top of the clouds are completely blown out, and the colors on the ground are a bit strange. So overall, a mixed bag.', '2007-10-26 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
