(4198544, 602953, 75034, '<td valign="top">I love refracted light and the result. I like the lighting on this shot.I hope you are not on the receiving end of comments that tell you they think it would be better if you straightened the shot because I think this works well just as it is. Nice capture. Hope it does well.</td>', 'I love refracted light and the result. I like the lighting on this shot.I hope you are not on the receiving end of comments that tell you they think it would be better if you straightened the shot because I think this works well just as it is. Nice capture. Hope it does well.', '2007-10-26 22:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
