(4200307, 601901, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice quick capture</td>', 'nice quick capture', '2007-10-27 23:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200309, 600656, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice job on the eyes, nice and sharp</td>', 'nice job on the eyes, nice and sharp', '2007-10-27 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200310, 602833, 73601, '<td valign="top">pretty image, creative idea for the challenge</td>', 'pretty image, creative idea for the challenge', '2007-10-27 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200312, 602987, 73601, '<td valign="top">very cool image</td>', 'very cool image', '2007-10-27 23:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200362, 602868, 75034, '<td valign="top">This works well in this challeng and I think it should do well. I like the contrast and the tones. You are drawn down the road with your subject. I would offer one thing for you to consider and that would be, instead of your subject standing facing you I feel that they should be in the act of walking down the road. It would hold up better in my opinion and give the actual flow to the shot. The placement of your subject is fine and the entire image is "TAC" sharp (f/11?) and overall this is very pleasing to the eye. Nice work.</td>', 'This works well in this challeng and I think it should do well. I like the contrast and the tones. You are drawn down the road with your subject. I would offer one thing for you to consider and that would be, instead of your subject standing facing you I feel that they should be in the act of walking down the road. It would hold up better in my opinion and give the actual flow to the shot. The placement of your subject is fine and the entire image is "TAC" sharp (f/11?) and overall this is very pleasing to the eye. Nice work.', '2007-10-27 23:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200367, 602202, 75034, '<td valign="top">I like your PP and the rainbow is nice and clear in your shot.</td>', 'I like your PP and the rainbow is nice and clear in your shot.', '2007-10-27 23:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200378, 603167, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is a different approach to this challenge and for that I applaude you.<br/>I think that if you were able to shoot this again I would try to get a sharper image throughout your shot so the rainbow colour is tac sharp and not in a forground bokeh. Remember it is just my opinion.</td>', 'This is a different approach to this challenge and for that I applaude you.I think that if you were able to shoot this again I would try to get a sharper image throughout your shot so the rainbow colour is tac sharp and not in a forground bokeh. Remember it is just my opinion.', '2007-10-28 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200386, 603075, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice, a double rainbow. I like the PP on this and how you got the rainbow to pop. Good work.</td>', 'Nice, a double rainbow. I like the PP on this and how you got the rainbow to pop. Good work.', '2007-10-28 00:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200398, 602408, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is certainly using your imagination. If you can''t find a rainbow then make one. The use of colours and the crop are nice. Sadly I don''t think it will hold up to well against some of the stronger images but it is not about how I feel and all about how others see your shot, so I hope you do well.</td>', 'This is certainly using your imagination. If you can''t find a rainbow then make one. The use of colours and the crop are nice. Sadly I don''t think it will hold up to well against some of the stronger images but it is not about how I feel and all about how others see your shot, so I hope you do well.', '2007-10-28 00:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200402, 602109, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF and use of dark background. This image plays on our fatination with bubbles from when we were kids, nice entry.</td>', 'Nice DoF and use of dark background. This image plays on our fatination with bubbles from when we were kids, nice entry.', '2007-10-28 00:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200407, 603126, 75034, '<td valign="top">Looks good and the colours are well done although I do find the forground to be a little dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Looks good and the colours are well done although I do find the forground to be a little dark on my monitor.', '2007-10-28 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200422, 602820, 75034, '<td valign="top">Now this is what I was looking for in this challenge. A good old-fashioned honest to goodness rainbow shot. Not that there is anything wrong with any of the other enteries but it is nice to see a great capture of a rainbow. I love your forground there is a lot of movement with the water and wind but it doesn''t detract from the shot at all it just helps to tell the story.</td>', 'Now this is what I was looking for in this challenge. A good old-fashioned honest to goodness rainbow shot. Not that there is anything wrong with any of the other enteries but it is nice to see a great capture of a rainbow. I love your forground there is a lot of movement with the water and wind but it doesn''t detract from the shot at all it just helps to tell the story.', '2007-10-28 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 1);
