(4203329, 603095, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh LISA!!!!!   What a delightful award winning photo!   This could not BE any more awesome!  Was she really jumping that high?   Or did you have one of those mini-trampolines there to give her extra bounce.  That is AMAZING!   CONGRATULATIONS!   YOUR photography is so amazing, and wonderfully getting the recognition it deserves!<br/></td>', 'Oh LISA!!!!!   What a delightful award winning photo!   This could not BE any more awesome!  Was she really jumping that high?   Or did you have one of those mini-trampolines there to give her extra bounce.  That is AMAZING!   CONGRATULATIONS!   YOUR photography is so amazing, and wonderfully getting the recognition it deserves!', '2007-10-29 10:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
