(4204265, 603095, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oooooo this photo caused me such grief because I would recognise that gorgeous model of yours anywhere in the world.  I felt to be fair I had to be really strict about how I marked the shot but the wonderful joie de vivre just was amazing (and was I promise exactly the expression I had used myself when I saw it) and the purple backdrop set the shot off magnificently<br/> <br/>It got a very harsh 7 from me because it deserved so much more.  I am  so glad you got another outstanding finish for this<br/> <br/>Jon</td>', 'Oooooo this photo caused me such grief because I would recognise that gorgeous model of yours anywhere in the world.  I felt to be fair I had to be really strict about how I marked the shot but the wonderful joie de vivre just was amazing (and was I promise exactly the expression I had used myself when I saw it) and the purple backdrop set the shot off magnificently It got a very harsh 7 from me because it deserved so much more.  I am  so glad you got another outstanding finish for this Jon', '2007-10-29 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
