(4204332, 603117, 53316, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9... I thought it was fantastic.  As a lot of the high-placing entries show, things don''t have to be in a rainbow arc to be "rainbow".  I actually looked very closely and you can see purple down at the bottom so it really does cover all the colors as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'I gave this a 9... I thought it was fantastic.  As a lot of the high-placing entries show, things don''t have to be in a rainbow arc to be "rainbow".  I actually looked very closely and you can see purple down at the bottom so it really does cover all the colors as far as I''m concerned.', '2007-10-29 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
