(4230892, 602598, 14620, '<td valign="top">Did you ever figure out how this got so many views?? Great score, BTW. :)<br/> <br/>Edit:  Ahhhhh, nevemind.  Figured it out, looks like you got <a href="//www.stumbleupon.com/url/dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php%3FIMAGE_ID=602598" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Stumbled Upon</a>.  cool! :)<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-08 01:06:02.</i></td>', 'Did you ever figure out how this got so many views?? Great score, BTW. :) Edit:  Ahhhhh, nevemind.  Figured it out, looks like you got Stumbled Upon.  cool! :) ', '2007-11-08 01:03:09.000000', '2007-11-08 01:06:02.000000', 0),
